{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioSettingsContexts",
  "$description": "Project Settings › Contexts: the base width, and the three groups of `$media` entries — size breakpoints, colour schemes and feature queries — a project's pages may be rendered under. The adapter hands in `groups`, already classified and already carrying each row's refusal, plus the base width and the two whole-file messages; nothing here decides what a context IS. Every control is the kit's, so the `+` that used to be typed into an add button's text and the `×` that stood in for a remove icon are glyphs now rather than characters.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "contexts"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What `.settings-media-list`, `.settings-media-row`, `.settings-media-name`, `.settings-media-name-fixed`, `.settings-media-value` and `.settings-section-notice` used to say in `styles/overlays.css`, keyed on `part` and re-pointed at the studio token layer. Those six were this section's alone and go with it. `.settings-section-title`, `.settings-field`, `.settings-field-label`, `.settings-field-desc` and `.settings-field-error` are NOT deleted with them: nine other settings sections are still lit and still name them, so those rules keep their stylesheet and this document carries its own copy of each until the last of those sections converts.",
    "display": "block",
    "& [part=\"title\"]": {
      "margin": "0 0 16px",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"intro\"], & [part=\"field-desc\"], & [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "$description": "The 12px secondary line, three times: the section's own sentence, a group's sentence, and the sentence a group shows instead of rows. It read `var(--spectrum-font-size-75, 12px)`, which resolved only inside `<sp-theme>` — a document is mounted in the pane, where that name is not in scope and every one of them would have taken the hard-coded fallback.",
      "margin": "0 0 6px",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "margin": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"field\"]": {
      "marginBottom": "20px"
    },
    "& [part=\"field-label\"]": {
      "$description": "A heading, where the lit section had a `<label>` that named nothing: a group label sits over a LIST of controls, so `for` had nowhere to point and the element was a label in class name only. Each control carries its own name instead, and the reader gets a heading they can navigate by.",
      "display": "block",
      "margin": "0 0 2px",
      "fontSize": "13px",
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "6px"
    },
    "& [part=\"row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "6px",
      "alignItems": "center"
    },
    "& [part=\"name-fixed\"]": {
      "$description": "The base width's name column, which is a word rather than a field. It is the same 80px the editable name fields below it are, so the base row and the group rows line up down one edge.",
      "width": "var(--jx-field-label-w)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "fontWeight": "500",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "padding": "0 8px"
    },
    "& [part=\"name\"]": {
      "width": "var(--jx-field-label-w)",
      "flex": "none"
    },
    "& [part=\"value\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "width": "100%"
    },
    "& [part=\"value-slot\"]": {
      "$description": "The one cell a size row fills with a text field and a scheme row fills with a select. It is the `$switch` container, so it — not the control — is what the row's flex line measures.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"row-error\"]": {
      "margin": "6px 0 0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"section-error\"]": {
      "margin": "6px 0 0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--danger)"
    },
    "& [part=\"notice\"]": {
      "$description": "A problem `project.json` already had, said once at section level. Deliberately not the danger colour: it refused nothing and it belongs to no control, so it is a warning about the file rather than a rejection of an edit.",
      "margin": "6px 0 0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--warning)"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "title"
      },
      "textContent": "Contexts"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "intro"
      },
      "textContent": "The conditions this project's pages are rendered under. Define them once here; choose between them on the pane's context control while you edit."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "section-error-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/hasSectionError"
      },
      "cases": {
        "true": {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section-error",
            "role": "alert"
          },
          "textContent": "${state.sectionError}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "notice-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/hasNotice"
      },
      "cases": {
        "true": {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "notice",
            "role": "status"
          },
          "textContent": "${state.notice}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "field"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "h4",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "field-label"
          },
          "textContent": "Base width"
        },
        {
          "tagName": "p",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "field-desc"
          },
          "textContent": "How wide the canvas is when no other context applies. Styles written here apply everywhere."
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "row"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "name-fixed"
              },
              "textContent": "Base"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
              "$props": {
                "label": "Base width",
                "value": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/base"
                },
                "placeholder": "1280px",
                "invalid": {
                  "$ref": "#/state/baseInvalid"
                },
                "size": "sm"
              },
              "attributes": {
                "part": "value",
                "data-context": "base"
              },
              "onchange": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/setBase"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "base-error-slot",
            "role": "none"
          },
          "$switch": {
            "$ref": "#/state/baseInvalid"
          },
          "cases": {
            "true": {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "row-error",
                "role": "alert"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.baseError}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "$prototype": "Array",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/state/groups"
      },
      "key": {
        "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
      },
      "map": {
        "tagName": "div",
        "attributes": {
          "part": "field",
          "data-context-group": "${$map.item.kind}"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "tagName": "h4",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "field-label"
            },
            "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
          },
          {
            "tagName": "p",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "field-desc"
            },
            "textContent": "${$map.item.desc}"
          },
          {
            "tagName": "div",
            "attributes": {
              "part": "list-slot",
              "role": "none"
            },
            "$switch": {
              "$ref": "$map/item/hasRows"
            },
            "cases": {
              "false": {
                "tagName": "p",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "empty"
                },
                "textContent": "${$map.item.empty}"
              },
              "true": {
                "tagName": "div",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "list"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "$prototype": "Array",
                    "items": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/rows"
                    },
                    "key": {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                    },
                    "map": {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "row-block",
                        "data-context": "${$map.item.key}"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "row"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                              "$props": {
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/nameLabel"
                                },
                                "value": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                                },
                                "placeholder": "name",
                                "invalid": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/invalid"
                                },
                                "size": "sm"
                              },
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "name"
                              },
                              "onchange": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/rename"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "value-slot",
                                "role": "none"
                              },
                              "$switch": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/control"
                              },
                              "cases": {
                                "query": {
                                  "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                                  "$props": {
                                    "label": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/valueLabel"
                                    },
                                    "value": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/query"
                                    },
                                    "placeholder": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/queryPlaceholder"
                                    },
                                    "invalid": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/invalid"
                                    },
                                    "size": "sm"
                                  },
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "value"
                                  },
                                  "onchange": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/setQuery"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                },
                                "scheme": {
                                  "tagName": "jx-select",
                                  "$props": {
                                    "label": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/valueLabel"
                                    },
                                    "options": [
                                      { "value": "light", "label": "Light" },
                                      { "value": "dark", "label": "Dark" }
                                    ],
                                    "value": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/scheme"
                                    },
                                    "size": "sm"
                                  },
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "value"
                                  },
                                  "onchange": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/setScheme"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          },
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                              "$props": {
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/removeLabel"
                                },
                                "hint": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/removeLabel"
                                },
                                "icon": "x",
                                "quiet": true,
                                "size": "sm"
                              },
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "remove",
                                "data-remove": "${$map.item.key}"
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/remove"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "row-error-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/invalid"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "true": {
                              "tagName": "p",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "row-error",
                                "role": "alert"
                              },
                              "textContent": "${$map.item.error}"
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "tagName": "jx-action-button",
            "$props": {
              "label": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/addLabel"
              },
              "icon": "plus",
              "size": "sm"
            },
            "attributes": {
              "part": "add",
              "data-add": "${$map.item.kind}"
            },
            "onclick": {
              "$prototype": "Function",
              "body": [
                {
                  "operator": "call",
                  "target": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/add"
                  },
                  "value": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "$map/item/kind"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "tagName": "span",
                "textContent": "${$map.item.addLabel}"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
